      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そいつはすごいな……。\r\nけど、どうしてそんな代物があったんだ。",
        "official_en": "That’s a heck of a gizmo. Where did you get it?",
        "real_en": "That's incredible... But why did you have something like that?"
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
