    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C05_502_01:502_01_010:357f1d5d",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_C05_502_01",
        "key": "502_01_010",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C05_502_01:502_01_010:357f1d5d",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_C05_502_01:502_01_010:357f1d5d",
        "jp_sha256": "3a1256eb295708395264458cc0a1aabe694956ce95cbf3b5e7d559bf894fa15d",
        "official_en_sha256": "1149a263f9fd8881634d800dd531192db74a0999825b166e1682d4fc31ac065c"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ですから、私は父上が遺したものを平和のために役立てたい。\r\nそれが息子としての責任だと思うのです。",
        "official_en": "Indeed, it did—which is why I intend to use what he left behind to bring about peace. That is my duty as his son.",
        "real_en": "That's why I want to use what Father left behind for peace. I think that's my duty as his son."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
