        "official_en_sha256": "2e910a3413d645e8900a665a4990f8b48885deb5700ce6590c0a57aab74e83a3"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "全てはゾルダードのために……。\r\n父上のその思いは純粋だったと思うのです。",
        "official_en": "He was willing to do anything for the good of Zoldaad... Though, I am sure his thoughts were pure in intent.",
        "real_en": "Everything was for Zoldaad... I believe Father's intentions were sincere."
      },
